        "image": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/wall.webp",
        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/wall.webp",
        "description": "<p>A ring around the grounds, begun as a timber palisade and raised over the years: a stone wall, reinforced with buttresses, and finally a wall walk with crenellations where defenders fight under cover.</p><p>The wall multiplies the garrison's strength and gives the Bastion Integrity that an attacker has to wear down before breaking in. Each step up is priced along the whole length of the wall; extending the grounds lengthens it. A Bastion has one wall.</p>"
      },
